,"dialogs":[{"nodeId":726740101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2942434370,"text":"五百蔵、元気にしてたか？","nextNodeIds":[726740102]},{"nodeId":726740102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":4019050682,"text":"ぬっ！見破られるとは何たる不覚！お前らはいったい…って、この匂いは…","nextNodeIds":[726740103]},{"nodeId":726740103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":783429146,"text":"何だ、お前らか。久しぶりだから匂いを忘れてしまっていたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740104]},{"nodeId":726740104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3514983866,"text":"五百蔵は相変わらずだな。人見知りだし、やっぱり石のままだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[726740105]},{"nodeId":726740105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1971279466,"text":"ぬ！？お前、それはどういう意味だ？","nextNodeIds":[726740106,726740107]},{"nodeId":726740106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3825230426,"text":"早く封印が解かれますように。","nextNodeIds":[726740108]},{"nodeId":726740108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":155186842,"text":"たかが人間ごときの封印！吾輩が本気を出せば…","nextNodeIds":[726740109]},{"nodeId":726740109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3402916186,"text":"コホン。","nextNodeIds":[726740110]},{"nodeId":726740110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1065602282,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[726740111]},{"nodeId":726740111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3528476826,"text":"#ふん。そう言えば、子狸たちがお前らに迷惑をかけたようだな。いい匂いがする金髪の{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}がよく遊んでくれると、小狸たちがいつも言っておる。","nextNodeIds":[726740112,726740113,726740114]},{"nodeId":726740112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4161452562,"text":"#金髪の{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}…","nextNodeIds":[726740115]},{"nodeId":726740115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3601362042,"text":"人間はみんな、吾輩たち妖狸一族を封印した奴のような悪人で、恐ろしい者だと思っていた。しかし今になってやっと、いい人もいると分かったのだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740116,726740117]},{"nodeId":726740116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1598629010,"text":"ほとんどがいい人だよ。","nextNodeIds":[726740118]},{"nodeId":726740118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":570128970,"text":"#そうだ。オイラと{NICKNAME}が会ってきた人間も、ほとんどがいい人だったぞ。五百蔵が封印されたのは、クシを盗んだせいじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[726740119]},{"nodeId":726740119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1494434946,"text":"ふん、クシはもう返したはずだ。もし霊善坊に法術を習った奴に会ったら伝えてくれ。吾輩を石から出せってな。","nextNodeIds":[726740120]},{"nodeId":726740120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3483501458,"text":"あのクソ狐のせいでここにだいぶ長居してしまった…","nextNodeIds":[726740121]},{"nodeId":726740121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2204184178,"text":"（愚痴を言う五百蔵ってなんだか、年取ったオヤジみたいだな。）","nextNodeIds":[726740122]},{"nodeId":726740122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2842096554,"text":"（実際かなり年のはずだよ。）","nextNodeIds":[726740123]},{"nodeId":726740123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1887813106,"text":"小童どもよ、お前らは手も足も石じゃないから、きっと色んな所に行ったことがあるだろ？","nextNodeIds":[726740124]},{"nodeId":726740124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1824886178,"text":"フフーン、オイラとこいつは海の向こう側から来たんだぜ！","nextNodeIds":[726740125]},{"nodeId":726740125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":1821231242,"text":"五百蔵に璃月とモンドについて話した。","nextNodeIds":[726740126]},{"nodeId":726740126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2465858138,"text":"…ほぉ、世の中には色んな所があるのだな。あっぱれだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740127]},{"nodeId":726740127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2827986434,"text":"これまでずっと小狸からの報告しか聞けなかったから、外の様子は全く分からなかった。","nextNodeIds":[726740128]},{"nodeId":726740128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2111695162,"text":"昔、影向山で北の海の向こうを眺めていると、とんでもなく高い山が見えたものだ。影向山よりも高いかもしれないな。それがどんな山なのか、ずっと知りたかったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740129,726740131]},{"nodeId":726740129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3606911490,"text":"あそこは…","nextNodeIds":[726740130]},{"nodeId":726740130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3285359458,"text":"方角からすると、多分ドラゴンスパインじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[726740132]},{"nodeId":726740132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1278213050,"text":"ぐぬぬ、ドラゴンスパイン…聞いただけで寒気がしてくる。アイツはなぜそんなところに行きたいのだ…","nextNodeIds":[726740133]},{"nodeId":726740133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2598299610,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[726740134]},{"nodeId":726740134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1647190898,"text":"コホンッ。さっきも言ったが、お前らはいい奴だ。だから…","nextNodeIds":[726740135]},{"nodeId":726740135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1687284122,"text":"オイラたちに頼みでもあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[726740136]},{"nodeId":726740136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2660842458,"text":"ぬ！こう見えても、吾輩は鎮守の森を守るよう、大御所様の命を受けた隠神保生司正だぞ！石に封印されていなければ、今頃は八畳敷の…","nextNodeIds":[726740137,726740138]},{"nodeId":726740137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2251877074,"text":"何か手伝えることは？","nextNodeIds":[726740143]},{"nodeId":726740143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1638477194,"text":"吾輩は自由に身動きがとれないが、子供たちは問題ない。小狸を外に連れ出し、「修行」の供をしてほしいのだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740144]},{"nodeId":726740144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3801255306,"text":"「吉法師」を連れて行くがいい。前回お前らと遊んだ後、ずっと会いたがっていてな。","nextNodeIds":[726740145,726740146]},{"nodeId":726740145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4175521194,"text":"いいけど…","nextNodeIds":[726740147]},{"nodeId":726740147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1778166610,"text":"そうだな。吉法師とは言葉が通じないから、一緒に旅をするとなると、きっと苦労するぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740148]},{"nodeId":726740148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3464739274,"text":"それなら問題あるまい。我ら妖狸一族は人間の言葉を理解している。お前ら人間が妖狸の言葉を理解できないだけだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740149]},{"nodeId":726740149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3569870186,"text":"え！そうだったのか！","nextNodeIds":[726740150]},{"nodeId":726740150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4250651682,"text":"でも旅仲間となると…","nextNodeIds":[726740151]},{"nodeId":726740151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4184531306,"text":"旅をしながら話もしたい。","nextNodeIds":[726740152]},{"nodeId":726740152,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1028056970,"text":"#オイラと{NICKNAME}みたいにな！","nextNodeIds":[726740153]},{"nodeId":726740153,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3740500946,"text":"ぬっ、しょうがない。以前、我ら妖狸一族の法術で、食べ物を作ってくれた奴がいただろ？","nextNodeIds":[726740154]},{"nodeId":726740154,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2837878418,"text":"この吾輩にかかれば、お前らが吉法師と話せるようにする「飯」を用意することなど、朝飯前だ。","nextNodeIds":[726740155]},{"nodeId":726740155,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1410903218,"text":"美味しい「飯」だ！やったぜ！","nextNodeIds":[726740156]},{"nodeId":726740156,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3303908146,"text":"美味しくないかもよ…","nextNodeIds":[726740157]},{"nodeId":726740157,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3779480082,"text":"ふん、吾輩の腕前を見くびってはいかんぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740158]},{"nodeId":726740158,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":1759498570,"text":"五百蔵はどこからこの料理を出したのだろう…\\n何はともあれ、パイモンと二人で、五百蔵のお腹に載った「見た目は美味しそうな料理」をいただいた。","nextNodeIds":[726740159]},{"nodeId":726740159,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":896416858,"text":"おお、うまいぞ！","nextNodeIds":[726740160]},{"nodeId":726740160,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3842468802,"text":"当然だ。吾輩はかつて泥団子と狸の毛で作った刺身の盛り合わせで、緒方の四鬼を騙したこともあるんだからな。","nextNodeIds":[726740161]},{"nodeId":726740161,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1299874450,"text":"五百蔵ってすごいんだな！それじゃあ、さっきオイラたちが食べたやつは、なにで作ったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[726740162]},{"nodeId":726740162,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1240353746,"text":"聞かないほうがいいこともある。","nextNodeIds":[726740163]},{"nodeId":726740163,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3886267698,"text":"？","nextNodeIds":[726740164]},{"nodeId":726740164,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2509426178,"text":"まあいいや、早速吉法師と話してみようぜ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726740146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3289245698,"text":"もう一つ問題がある…","nextNodeIds":[726740147]},{"nodeId":726740138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":243148058,"text":"まあね…","nextNodeIds":[726740139]},{"nodeId":726740139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2187062482,"text":"#おう、{NICKNAME}の考えてることは分かるぞ！つまり、お宝はあるのかってことだよな？","nextNodeIds":[72674014