0310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":963386482,"text":"いや、全然ダメだろ！吉法師がなにを言いたいのか、オイラほとんど理解できないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740312]},{"nodeId":726740312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3598255786,"text":"そうだそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740313]},{"nodeId":726740313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2121021490,"text":"五百蔵に、吉法師との交流について伝えた。","nextNodeIds":[726740314]},{"nodeId":726740314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":47870618,"text":"ほう、なるほどな。安心するがいい。それはお前らが、まだ吉法師の匂いに慣れていないからだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740315]},{"nodeId":726740315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1845804306,"text":"焦らずゆっくり慣れて行け！吉法師の匂いに慣れたら、話していることも理解できるようになる。","nextNodeIds":[726740316]},{"nodeId":726740316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1890241162,"text":"「ゆっくり」って、いったいどれくらいかかるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[726740317]},{"nodeId":726740317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3760380354,"text":"それは…そうだな…","nextNodeIds":[726740318]},{"nodeId":726740318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":4081772858,"text":"ぬ！とにかく焦るでない。せっかちなやつらだな。","nextNodeIds":[726740319]},{"nodeId":726740319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":2391115602,"text":"せっかち、いくない。","nextNodeIds":[726740320]},{"nodeId":726740320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3880699490,"text":"もしかして、五百蔵も分からないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740321]},{"nodeId":726740321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2154103538,"text":"ふん！吾輩は長い時を生きてきた妖狸大王隠神五百蔵だぞ。お前ら人間のように、時間など一々気にしないのだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740322]},{"nodeId":726740322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":791646650,"text":"（ほとんどの時間、石像に封印されてたけどな。）","nextNodeIds":[726740323]},{"nodeId":726740323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1571053194,"text":"でもどうして五百蔵は人と話せるんだろう？","nextNodeIds":[726740324]},{"nodeId":726740324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3254199290,"text":"ぬ、無礼な。なぜ人間が吾輩と会話できるのか、と尋ねるべきだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740325]},{"nodeId":726740325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1616768602,"text":"吾輩のように長生きしてきた強き妖狸は、多かれ少なかれ、人間と接した経験がある。","nextNodeIds":[726740326]},{"nodeId":726740326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3081173082,"text":"遠い昔、吾輩たちは天狗や狐、鬼に妖怪、そして人間たちとよく話したものだ。人の物語には人の話しか出て来ないが、実はそのうちの半分くらいは人間に化けた妖狸の話なのだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740327]},{"nodeId":726740327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":4047871130,"text":"残りは人間自身の物語と、天狗に狐、鬼や妖怪の物語が半分ずつだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740328]},{"nodeId":726740328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2304156418,"text":"しかし、さらにその半分には、彼らに変装した我ら妖狸たちの物語が含まれている。そして妖狸に関する物語の半分は、吾輩五百蔵の話なのだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740329]},{"nodeId":726740329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1603840682,"text":"つまり、吾輩はただ者ではないのだ。お前らと話すことなど造作もないこと。","nextNodeIds":[726740330]},{"nodeId":726740330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3105471994,"text":"分かった、十六分の五が五百蔵の物語。","nextNodeIds":[726740331]},{"nodeId":726740331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2630892602,"text":"ぬ？「十六分の五」…美味い食べ物の名前か？","nextNodeIds":[726740332]},{"nodeId":726740332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":3281694306,"text":"美味しそう。食べたい。","nextNodeIds":[726740333]},{"nodeId":726740333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2919552298,"text":"#{NICKNAME}はさっきの話から、五百蔵に関する物語の割合を計算しただけだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740334]},{"nodeId":726740334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":2031388722,"text":"五百蔵、すごい。","nextNodeIds":[726740335]},{"nodeId":726740335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2033793218,"text":"うぬ、当たり前だ。吾輩のすごさを、しっかりと見習うがいい。","nextNodeIds":[726740336]},{"nodeId":726740336,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1644070402,"text":"あれ？だんだん「吉法師」の言ってることが分かるようになって来たような気がするぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740337]},{"nodeId":726740337,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":300511290,"text":"白髪、賢い。","nextNodeIds":[726740338]},{"nodeId":726740338,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":224573450,"text":"褒められたはずなのに、なんだか嬉しくないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[726740339]},{"nodeId":726740339,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3865109178,"text":"ふむ、良かろう。その子はお前らに託したぞ。修行に付き合ってやってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[726740340]},{"nodeId":726740340,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":1552988034,"text":"吾輩がまだ若かったころも、稲妻の十八ヶ所や、大妖狸「九百九」の旧跡を訪ねたものだ。そして狸の進むべき道を貫いたからこそ、このような偉業を成し遂げられたのだ。","nextNodeIds":[726740341]},{"nodeId":726740341,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4128850930,"text":"おぉ！だから五百蔵は石に封印されたのか。","nextNodeIds":[726740342]},{"nodeId":726740342,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":1857288482,"text":"ぬはは、石に封印。","nextNodeIds":[726740343]},{"nodeId":726740343,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2420364666,"text":"ぬ！？吉法師、お前まで…","nextNodeIds":[726740344]},{"nodeId":726740344,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4244379970,"text":"本題に戻ろうぜ！オイラたち最初はどこに行けばいいんだ？","nextNodeIds":[726740345,726740347]},{"nodeId":726740345,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1427759146,"text":"五百蔵がさっき言った…","nextNodeIds":[726740346]},{"nodeId":726740346,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1146311610,"text":"ああ、そうだな！ドラゴンスパインへ出発しよう！","nextNodeIds":[726740348]},{"nodeId":726740348,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1458122378,"text":"「そこに山があるから」——くぅ、やっとこのセリフをカッコよく言える時が来たぜ！","nextNodeIds":[726740349]},{"nodeId":726740349,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":1376070562,"text":"そこに山があるから！","nextNodeIds":[726740350]},{"nodeId":726740350,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":2229522322,"text":"ぬぅぅ、聞いただけで寒くなってきた…吉法師、決してお腹を冷やすんじゃないぞ。風邪を引いてしまうと、腹太鼓が叩けなくなるからな。","nextNodeIds":[726740351]},{"nodeId":726740351,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","textMapHash":3680743834,"text":"#そして、飯もちゃんと食うんだ。外にいる時は金髪の{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}にしっかりとついて行くんだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726740352]},{"nodeId":726740352,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":204013634,"text":"#分かった！金髪の{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}について行く。","nextNodeIds":[726740353,726740354,726740355]},{"nodeId":726740353,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3253435754,"text":"吉法師は任せて。","nextNodeIds":[726740356]},{"nodeId":726740356,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3485494570,"text":"よろしくな、吉法師！","nextNodeIds":[726740357]},{"nodeId":726740357,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":3775340066,"text":"ぬ、心配無用！吉法師が面倒みる！","nextNodeIds":[726740358]},{"nodeId":726740358,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1426269058,"text":"やっぱりまだ分かり合えないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726740354,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3844144226,"text":"心配しないで。","nextNodeIds":[726740356]},{"nodeId":726740355,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":206882770,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}じゃなくて{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！","nextNodeIds":[726740356]},{"nodeId":726740347,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4037913242,"text":"ドラゴンスパインはどう？","nextNodeIds":[726740348]},{"nodeId":726740311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2276422834,"text":"結構大きな問題が…","nextNodeIds":[726740312]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7267403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3159"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7267401,7267402,7267403,7267404],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3159,"speakerName":"五百蔵","count":48},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":37},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":36},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","count":15},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[172674],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CB